        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Finally, Figure 7(e) illustrates the BN for the Health domain. The extra variables Density, Geographical area, Higher education rate, and GDP serve as input nodes in the model. These variables reflect both the geographical disparities across the Italian provinces and the influence of economic resources on access to healthcare. Additionally, Health status equality and Health access equality are conditionally independent given the Higher education rate, indicating a connection between educational attainment and equitable health outcomes. The Health Domain node is associated with a table whose values are given by an expression integrating Health status equality and Health access equality, in accordance with GEI guidelines. In the next Section, the usage of the OOBN is shown by simulating different scenarios.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
